  5 |     bad_cmd: Sh{"{bad_prog} status"}
    |                   ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The program position of `Sh` accepts only a literal program name or a `Path`, not `String`; pass a `Path` (e.g. `Path.from(…)`) or write the program name literally
 Fix: Pass a value of a type this place accepts, or move the hole to a place that accepts its type
